tellraw @s {"rawtext":[{"text":"§b===== 野外随机生成框架 RSF v2.0.0 =====\n§7· /scoreboard players list RSF_GLOBAL §f看时钟与回执\n§7· /scoreboard players set period rsf_cfg 2400 §f改周期(刻)\n§7· /scoreboard players set enabled rsf_cfg 0 §f一键关闭\n§7· /scoreboard players set build_mode rsf_cfg 0 §f改回「只放标记」模式\n§7· /testfor @a[tag=rsf_last_spawner] §f看谁触发了生成\n§7· /testfor @e[tag=rsf_built] §f看哪些建筑已竣工\n§7改 rsf_config 与 rsf_build_steps 两个文件即可换成你自己的建筑\n§7三世界生效：主世界 / 下界 / 末地"}]}
